What is PAKAGES?

Pakages are ntg but folder or directories.
A pakage is a collection of related classes and interclasses.
Pakages help in naming conflicts and they improve code redability and maintanance , especally in large projects.
Pakages also help in controling access using Access modifiers.
Searching and maintanance of the program becomew easy when we have multiple packages.

There are two types of pakages 
  1  inbuilt pakage.
  2  User defined pakage.
